  "metaDescription": "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) has responded to claims by government official Raffi Ahmad regarding consultations on his professional activities.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The KPK has addressed statements regarding consultations held in 2024 concerning the professional roles of Raffi Ahmad.",
    "Raffi Ahmad stated he previously consulted with the commission about maintaining artistic work while serving as a public official.",
